  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Harnessing the Power of the Social and Human Sciences to Shape Inclusive, Sustainable, and Just Societies in Southeast Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In line with the Position Paper for the Social and Human Sciences in Southeast Asia, developed in 2023 by the Bangkok Office, this workplan will seek to boost the social and human departments (universities and research institutes) in supporting policymakers to device on alternative development models that improve the quality of life of the people. This workplan will be the matrix to which the OP 1, 3, and 4 contribute.</narrative>
  </description>
